  1673                              <1> ; =============================================================================
  1674                              <1> ;  The imports: kernel32.dll only. An import directory entry, the import
  1675                              <1> ;  lookup table, the hint/name entries and the DLL's name; then the import
  1676                              <1> ;  address table, which the loader fills in, right below `next`, so that
  1677                              <1> ;  CALL [EBP+d8] reaches it.
  1678                              <1> ; =============================================================================
  1679                              <1> %macro  IMPORTS 1
  1680                              <1>         IMP     GetStdHandle
  1681                              <1>         IMP     GetConsoleMode
  1682                              <1>         IMP     SetConsoleMode
